{"step_index":1041,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:46:27Z","input_tokens":7440,"cache_read_tokens":135894,"output_tokens":2959,"thinking":"Defining new types for the Hermes 7-Agent Committee architecture will be the initial focus. The `MarketCategory`, `ExecutionMode`, and `EngineMode` enums must be clearly defined within the `src/types.ts` file, ensuring all possible states are enumerated. The `AgentCommittee` type will then be structured to include an `atlas` member with an associated `bias` which could be either 'BULLISH' or 'BEARISH'.\n\n\nNow examining the Hermes 7-Agent Committee's internal states. I will integrate the diverse data from each agent, assessing risk profiles, potential news impacts, and trade recommendations. This aggregate view will inform the next architectural refinements.\n\n\nThe `SEMI_AUTO` mode requires integrating user input for trade approval or veto, which necessitates a 15-second countdown timer within the HermesDesk view. I must now determine how to structure the trade proposal data to effectively convey the core parameters, including risk levels and target profit goals. The simulation parameters for both prop firm and crypto environments need to be factored into the overall design.\n\nAdditionally, I'll incorporate the self-evolving engine's mechanics: XP accumulation based on market analysis and trade outcomes must inform decisions. UI elements will provide toggles for various operation modes, markets, and execution styles. These UI features must align with the underlying engine capabilities.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"export type TraderStatus = 'FOLLOWING' | 'FIRED' | 'BENCH';\n\nexport interface Trader {\n  id: string;\n  handle: string;\n  name: string;\n  initials: string;\n  avatarColor: string;\n  rank: number;\n  weeklyRank: string;\n  sevenDayReturn: number;\n  winRate: number;\n  copyRatio: number;\n  status: TraderStatus;\n  pnlWithUs: number;\n  lastSix: ('W' | 'L')[];\n}\n\nexport type LogType = 'COPY' | 'EXIT' | 'FIRE' | 'SCAN' | 'PICK' | 'SYSTEM' | 'QUANT' | 'HERMES' | 'EVOLUTION';\n\nexport interface TradeLog {\n  id: string;\n  timestamp: string;\n  type: LogType;\n  traderHandle?: string;\n  token?: string;\n  action?: 'bought' | 'sold' | 'fired' | 'picked' | 'scanned' | 'approved' | 'vetoed' | 'evolved';\n  amountUsd?: number;\n  pnlUsd?: number;\n  pnlPercent?: number;\n  copyRatio?: string;\n  message: string;\n  isLoss?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface ChartPoint {\n  timeIndex: number;\n  timeLabel: string;\n  balance: number;\n  traderHandle: string;\n  traderColor: string;\n  isFiredPoint?: boolean;\n  isHandoverPoint?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport type MarketRegime = 'TRENDING' | 'MEAN_REVERTING' | 'HIGH_VOL' | 'CRISIS';\n\nexport interface QuantState {\n  regime: MarketRegime;\n  midPrice: number;\n  spreadPercent: number;\n  orderBookImbalance: number; // -1.0 to +1.0\n  realizedVolatility: number; // e.g. 18.4%\n  currentDrawdown: number; // e.g. 2.1%\n  maxDrawdownLimit: number; // 15.0%\n  armedKillSwitch: boolean;\n  fractionalKelly: number; // 0.25 (Quarter-Kelly)\n  confidence: number; // 0.0 to 1.0\n  setupQuality: number; // 0 to 3\n  reflexLatencyMs: number; // ~81ms\n  deepBrainEscalations: number;\n}\n\nexport type EngineMode = 'COPY_TRADING' | 'QUANT_REGIME' | 'HERMES_DESK';\nexport type MarketCategory = 'CRYPTO' | 'PROP_FIRM';\nexport type ExecutionMode = 'AUTOPILOT' | 'SEMI_AUTO';\n\n// 7-Agent Committee Types\nexport interface AtlasAgent {\n  bias: 'BULLISH' | 'BEARISH' | 'NEUTRAL';\n  macroSummary: string;\n  keyLevel: number;\n  confidence: number;\n}\n\nexport interface LumenAgent {\n  newsStatus: 'CLEAR' | 'CAUTION' | 'DESK_LOCKED';\n  nextEvent: string;\n  minutesUntil: number;\n  isLocked: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface HydraAgent {\n  setupGrade: 'A+' | 'A' | 'B' | 'C' | 'VETOED';\n  score: number; // 0 - 100\n  reasons: string[];\n  isVetoed: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface SentinelAgent {\n  riskUsd: number;\n  riskPercent: number; // e.g. 0.75%\n  consecutiveLosses: number;\n  maxLosses: number; // 2\n  isHalted: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface HephaestusAgent {\n  instrument: string;\n  action: 'BUY' | 'SELL';\n  entryPrice: number;\n  stopLoss: number;\n  targetPrice: number;\n  riskRewardRatio: number;\n}\n\nexport interface MnemosyneAgent {\n  totalReviewed: number;\n  totalApproved: number;\n  totalVetoed: number;\n  winRate: number;\n  recentLearnings: string[];\n}\n\nexport interface HermesAgent {\n  verdict: 'APPROVE' | 'VETO' | 'STAND_ASIDE' | 'PENDING_USER_APPROVAL';\n  confidence: number;\n  summary: string;\n}\n\nexport interface HermesCommittee {\n  atlas: AtlasAgent;\n  lumen: LumenAgent;\n  hydra: HydraAgent;\n  sentinel: SentinelAgent;\n  hephaestus: HephaestusAgent;\n  mnemosyne: MnemosyneAgent;\n  hermes: HermesAgent;\n}\n\n// Self-Evolving Learning State\nexport interface AdaptiveWeights {\n  regimePrecision: number; // bonus %\n  falseBreakoutFilter: number; // bonus %\n  sentimentCalibration: number; // bonus %\n  dynamicSizingEdge: number; // bonus %\n}\n\nexport interface EvolutionEvent {\n  id: string;\n  timestamp: string;\n  text: string;\n  type: 'XP' | 'LEVEL_UP' | 'WEIGHT_UPDATE';\n}\n\nexport interface EvolutionState {\n  level: number;\n  title: string;\n  xp: number;\n  nextLevelXp: number;\n  winStreak: number;\n  totalTrades: number;\n  totalWins: number;\n  adaptiveWeights: AdaptiveWeights;\n  recentEvolutions: EvolutionEvent[];\n}\n\nexport interface PendingOrder {\n  id: string;\n  instrument: string;\n  action: 'BUY' | 'SELL';\n  entryPrice: number;\n  stopLoss: number;\n  targetPrice: number;\n  riskUsd: number;\n  riskPercent: number;\n  setupGrade: string;\n  gradeScore: number;\n  rationale: string;\n  timeRemainingSec: number;\n  potentialProfitUsd: number;\n}\n","Description":"Extend types.ts with 7-Agent Committee, Self-Evolving Engine, Prop Firm Mode, and HITL Pending Order models","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/types.ts","toolAction":"Updating types.ts","toolSummary":"Update types.ts with Hermes Desk types"}}]}
